<title>NORWAY: FORECAST-Statistics Norway sees '97 GDP at 3.0 pct.</title>
<headline>FORECAST-Statistics Norway sees '97 GDP at 3.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics Norway on Thursday revised forecasts for economic indicators in a quarterly report as follows.</p>
<p>				  (growth rates in pct unless stated):</p>
<p>				 December forecast    September forecast</p>
<p>				   1996     1997	   1996    1997</p>
<p> GDP				4.8	3.0	    4.3     2.3</p>
<p> GDP mainland		   3.1	2.7	    3.0     2.4</p>
<p> CPI				1.3	2.3	    1.4     2.2</p>
</text>
